{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":44,"ref":"jeremiah 50:44","book":"jeremiah","lang":"id","chapter":50,"translation":"Lihat, seperti singa naik dari semak Jordan ke padok yang teguh; sebab Aku akan mendadak membuatnya berlari dari atasnya, dan siapa pilihan yang akan Kutunjuk atasnya? Sebab siapa seperti Aku? Dan siapa yang akan menetapkan waktu bagi-Ku? Dan siapakah gembala ini yang akan berdiri di hadapan-Ku?","tokens":[{"surface":"הנה","gloss":"Lihat"},{"surface":"כאריה","gloss":"seperti singa"},{"surface":"יעלה","gloss":"naik"},{"surface":"מגאון","gloss":"dari semak"},{"surface":"הירדן","gloss":"Jordan"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"ke"},{"surface":"נוה","gloss":"padok"},{"surface":"איתן","gloss":"yang teguh"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"sebab"},{"surface":"ארגעה","gloss":"Aku akan mendadak"},{"surface":"ארוצם","gloss":"membuatnya berlari"},{"surface":"מעליה","gloss":"dari atasnya"},{"surface":"ומי","gloss":"dan siapa"},{"surface":"בחור","gloss":"pilihan"},{"surface":"אליה","gloss":"atasnya"},{"surface":"אפקד","gloss":"akan Kutunjuk"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"sebab"},{"surface":"מי","gloss":"siapa"},{"surface":"כמוני","gloss":"seperti Aku"},{"surface":"ומי","gloss":"dan siapa"},{"surface":"יועדני","gloss":"yang akan menetapkan waktu bagi-Ku"},{"surface":"ומי","gloss":"dan siapakah"},{"surface":"זה","gloss":"ini"},{"surface":"רעה","gloss":"gembala"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"yang"},{"surface":"יעמד","gloss":"akan berdiri"},{"surface":"לפני","gloss":"di hadapan-Ku"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-08T08:43:53.872856747Z","model":"glm-5.2"}